Deploy Entire Portal
```

---

## With Module Federation

Required:

```text
Build Customer Remote
Deploy Customer Remote
```

Only.

Shell remains untouched.

---

# How Does Shell Know About the Remote?

Shell loads:

```text
remoteEntry.js
```

from the Remote application.

Example:

```text
https://customer.company.com/remoteEntry.js
```

When Customer Remote is redeployed:

```text
remoteEntry.js
```

is updated automatically.

Shell loads the latest version.

