# Deployment Challenge #1

Version Compatibility

Example:

```text
Shell -> Angular 20

Customer -> Angular 18
```

Potential issues may occur.

Solution:

```typescript
shared:
{
  '@angular/core':
  {
    singleton: true,
    strictVersion: true
  }
}
```

---

# Deployment Challenge #2

Remote Unavailable

Suppose:

```text
Customer Remote Server Down
```

Shell cannot load:

```text
remoteEntry.js
```

Result:

```text
Customer Module Fails
```

---

## Recommended Handling

Show:

```text
Customer Module Temporarily Unavailable
```

instead of crashing the application.

---

# Deployment Challenge #3

Browser Caching

User may still load an older:

```text
remoteEntry.js
```

after deployment.

Common solutions:

```text
Cache Busting
Versioning
CDN Invalidation
```

