# Interview Question

## What is the benefit of deploying Shell and Remotes independently?

### Answer

Module Federation allows each Micro Frontend to be built and deployed separately. A change in one Remote application does not require rebuilding or redeploying the Shell or other Remotes. This enables faster releases, independent team ownership, reduced deployment risk, and better scalability.

